<dt><a href="/wiki/Help_Desk" title="Help Desk">Help Desk</a></dt>
<dd>Calls to a support desk</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/Guest_House" title="Guest House">Guest House</a></dt>
<dd>Managing bookings for a hotel</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/AdventureWorks" title="AdventureWorks">Adventure Works</a></dt>
<dd>An example based on a wholesaler (based on MicroSoft's sample database)</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/Neeps" title="Neeps">University Timetables</a></dt>
<dd>Schedules for lectures and tutorials</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/Musicians" title="Musicians">Musicians</a></dt>
<dd>Bands, Concerts, Performances</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/Dressmaker" title="Dressmaker">Dressmaker</a></dt>
<dd>Making and ordering dresses</dd>
<dt><a href="/wiki/Congestion_Charging" title="Congestion Charging">Congestion Charging</a></dt>
<dd>Monitoring and charging cars going in and out of London</dd></dl>
